|errata_history=This is the errata version PC-E2 of [[Scarif: Citadel Tower]] (version 3 of 3). The image here is the current Players Committee card image published 9 March 2026. This is the current text. Each version below is quoted in full with its dated source.
* '''Original''' ([[Scarif: Citadel Tower]]): Virtual Set 16 release; card image first published 3 September 2021<ref name="img-o-0">Players Committee card image <code>Virtual16-Dark/large/scarifcitadeltower.gif</code> as published 3 September 2021: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/b4a011ace2799d9e188578c4043193ff94a7a06c/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual16-Dark/large/scarifcitadeltower.gif holotable commit b4a011a] (the PC's card-image repository, which serves res.starwarsccg.org/cards).</ref>: “Dark: If a player just Force drained here, they may raise a converted Scarif location to the top. Light: Unless your spy here, total ability of 6 or more required for you to draw battle destiny here.”
* '''PC-E1''' ([[Scarif: Citadel Tower (Errata)]]): Card image published 1 June 2022<ref name="img-PC-E1-0">Players Committee card image <code>Virtual16-Dark/large/scarifcitadeltower.gif</code> as published 1 June 2022: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/e8445f08fa931119eec2c3f95d5cea095145da26/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual16-Dark/large/scarifcitadeltower.gif holotable commit e8445f0] (the PC's card-image repository, which serves res.starwarsccg.org/cards).</ref>: “Dark: If a player just Force drained here, they may raise a converted Scarif location to the top. Light: Unless your spy here, total ability of 6 or more required for you to draw battle destiny here.” '''What changed:''' No change to the game text words. Visible changes on the image only: the PC re-rendered the Virtual Set 16 card images (the side credit and copyright lines and the typesetting of the game text changed; on some cards icons or the set-icon position also changed); the game text words are the same. A version under Bill's 12 November 2026 ruling (every visible change on a PC image is a version).
* '''PC-E2''' (this page): Card image published 9 March 2026, and the current [https://res.starwarsccg.org/cardlists/Set16Type.html Virtual Set 16 card list]<ref name="img-PC-E2-0">Players Committee card image <code>Virtual16-Dark/large/scarifcitadeltower.gif</code> as published 9 March 2026: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/6f23e077ed3f1bb8f34b62099641028868d7a2ae/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual16-Dark/large/scarifcitadeltower.gif holotable commit 6f23e07] (the PC's card-image repository, which serves res.starwarsccg.org/cards).</ref>: “Dark: If Krennic or a Death Trooper here, Force drain +1 here. Light: If Cassian, Jyn, or K-2SO here, Force drain +1 here.” '''What changed:''' Light Side text “Unless your spy here, total ability of 6 or more required for you to draw battle destiny here.” became “If Cassian, Jyn, or K-2SO here, Force drain +1 here.”. Dark Side text “If a player just Force drained here, they may raise a converted Scarif location to the top.” became “If Krennic or a Death Trooper here, Force drain +1 here.”.
|versions='''Virtual Modern''' — [[Scarif: Citadel Tower]]<br />'''Virtual Modern Errata''' — [[Scarif: Citadel Tower (Errata)]]<br />'''Virtual Modern Errata 2''' — '''this page'''
